attribution: African-American spiritual from the first half of the 19th century, printed in 1882 in M. G. Slayton's Jubilee Songs and Marshall W. Taylor's Revival Hymns and Plantation Melodies. Anonymous and traditional, public domain worldwide. The C sharp is the raised leading note of the minor key and is expected to show as out-of-key.
